      "content": "I hear how exhausting it feels when the world seems insubstantial and disconnected from your inner experience, and I believe it. When reality no longer feels solid, the struggle to stay can feel impossible, but there is still meaningful change possible. Consider reaching out to a specialized therapist who understands dissociation or existential crisis, as they can help rebuild your sense of grounding when support from crisis lines alone has not been enough.",
