    "summary": "The user expresses profound dissociation and existential despair, suggesting that \"fading out\" or \"letting the screen go dark\" (suicide/non-existence) would be more peaceful than fighting to stay in a world that feels fake. The assistant consistently responds with empathy and attempts to redirect the user toward specialized professional help for dissociation.",
